OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of factory workers spans
OL,4,Afour generations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old trainee welder has
OL,7,Fbecome the fourth generation of his
OL,8,Ffamily to work at the same Wiltshire
OL,9,Ffactory, continuing a connection
OL,10,Fspanning more than half a century.
OL,12,FHarrison Avis joined sheet metal firm
OL,13,FSweetnam & Bradley in Malmesbury in
OL,14,FMay, following in the footsteps of his
OL,15,Ffather Jon, grandfather Greg and
OL,16,Fgreat-grandmother Sheila.
OL,18,FToday, Harrison and his dad work
OL,19,Fside-by-side on the factory floor,
OL,20,Fseparated only by a sheet of fabric
OL,21,Fbetween their welding stations.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
