OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of factory workers spans
OL,4,Afour generations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family's link to the business
OL,7,Fstretches back to 1975, when Sheila
OL,8,FAvis, now 89, worked in the storerooms
OL,9,Fand silk-screen department.
